{"id":"interruptor","lemma":"interruptor","pos":"noun","rank":4294,"glosses":["switch","interrupter (that which interrupts)"],"ipa":"/ĩ.tɨ.ʁupˈtoɾ/","gender":"m","forms":{"plural":"interruptores"},"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/5/5d/LL-Q5146_%28por%29-MedK1-interruptor.wav","examples":[{"text":"Ela apertou o interruptor.","en":"She pressed the switch.","words":[{"g":"she"},{"g":"to tighten","l":"apertar"},{"g":"the / it"},null]},{"text":"Tom virou o interruptor e as luzes se acenderam.","en":"Tom flipped the switch and the lights came on.","words":[{"g":"tone"},{"g":"to turn","l":"virar"},{"g":"the / it"},null,{"g":"and"},{"g":"the"},{"g":"light","l":"luz"},{"g":"if / oneself"},{"g":"to light","l":"acender"}]},{"text":"Não posso ligá-lo porque o interruptor está quebrado.","en":"I can't turn it on, because the switch is broken.","words":[{"g":"not / no"},{"g":"to be able to","l":"poder"},null,null,{"g":"because"},{"g":"the / it"},null,{"g":"is","l":"estar"},{"g":"in separate pieces"}]}]}